"></a><a class=\"social-share-icon icon-qq\" href=\"http://connect.qq.com/widget/shareqq/index.html?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.by.gov.cn%2Fgzjg%2Fqrlzyhshbzj%2Fzcgg%2Fcjgg%2Fcontent%2Fpost_10451075.html&amp;title=%E7%99%BD%E4%BA%91%E5%8C%BA%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%BA%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%9D%90%E6%96%99%E6%B8%85%E5%8D%95-%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E5%B8%82%E7%99%BD%E4%BA%91%E5%8C%BA%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E9%97%A8%E6%88%B7%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99&amp;source=%E7%99%BD%E4%BA%91%E5%8C%BA%E5%8A%B3%E5%8A%A8%E4%BA%BA%E4%BA%8B%E4%BA%89%E8%AE%AE%E4%BB%B2%E8%A3%81%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E6%9D%90%E6%96%99%E6%B8%85%E5%8D%95-%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E5%B8%82%E7%99%BD%E4%BA%91%E5%8C%BA%E4%BA%BA%E6%B0%91%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E9%97%A8%E6%88%B7%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99&amp;desc=%E6%AD%A4%E6%A0%8F%E7%9B%AE%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E3%80%82&amp;pics=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.by.gov.cn%2F2025%2Fimages%2Flogo2_red.png\" target=\"_blank\"></a></div>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"article-box\">\n        <div class=\"article-content\" id=\"zoomcon\">\n          <p style=\"margin: 15px 0;text-align: center;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 16px;text-indent: 0;text-wrap: wrap;padding: 0\" data-content-tag=\"2\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: #333333;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px\">白云区劳动人事争议仲裁申请材料清单</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 15px 0;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 16px;text-indent: 0;text-wrap: wrap;padding: 0\" data-content-tag=\"3\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: #333333;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px\">　　<span style=\"font-family:宋体\">1.申请人身份证正反面复印件两份（签名并盖手印）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 15px 0;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 16px;text-indent: 0;text-wrap: wrap;padding: 0\" data-content-tag=\"4\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: #333333;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px\">　　<span style=\"font-family:宋体\">2.被申请人的工商登记资料一份(通过“国家企业信用信息公示系统”查询截图打印)；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 15px 0;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 16px;text-indent: 0;text-wrap: wrap;padding: 0\" data-content-tag=\"5\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: #333333;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px\">　　<span style=\"font-family:宋体\">3.当事人送达地址确认书一份（详见附件1，填完签名并盖手印）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 15px 0;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 16px;text-indent: 0;text-wrap: wrap;padding: 0\" data-content-tag=\"6\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: #333333;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px\">　　<span style=\"font-family:宋体\">4.仲裁申请书一式两份（详见附件1，填完在第2页“申请人”和第4页“提交人”处签名并盖手印）；其中证据清单里面的证明对象写该证据的证明目的；页码请按顺序排列编号，注明第几至第几页；身份证件和企业注册登记信息不属于证据，无须在清单内填写；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 15px 0;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 16px;text-indent: 0;text-wrap: wrap;padding: 0\" data-content-tag=\"7\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: #333333;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px\">　　<span style=\"font-family:宋体\">5.证据材料一式两份复印件（只需交复印件，原件自行保存，且要有能证明与被申请人存在劳动关系的证据材料）。如证据为录音材料，需提交光盘刻录件，同时附上录音内容文字版说明；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 15px 0;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 16px;text-indent: 0;text-wrap: wrap;padding: 0\" data-content-tag=\"8\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: #333333;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px\">　　<span style=\"font-family:宋体\">6.劳动争议仲裁收件单及其存根各一份（详见附件1，其中建议勾选愿意调解，可提高争议化解速度）。本委收件后会将盖章版的劳动争议仲裁收件单按照申请人送达地址确认书上填写的通讯地址，邮寄送达申请人。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: #333333;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px\">请务必确保联系方式真实有效。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 15px 0;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 16px;text-indent: 0;text-wrap: wrap;padding: 0\" data-content-tag=\"9\">　　<strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: #333333;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">备注：以上所有材料均需使用黑色签字笔填写，其中</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">4、5两份</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #333333; letter-spacing: 0px;\">材料，如被申请人多于一个的，每增加一个被申请人则多提交一份。例如，被申请人为两个的，4、5材料则需各提交一式三份</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #333333; letter-spacing: 0px;\">。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 15px 0;text-align: center;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 16px;text-indent: 0;text-wrap: wrap;padding: 0\" data-content-tag=\"13\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: #333333;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px\">文书填写说明</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 15px 0;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 16px;text-indent: 0;text-wrap: wrap;padding: 0\" data-content-tag=\"14\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: #333333;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">　　请以附件</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">2“部分立案材料填写模板（可参考）”为参考认真填写相关文书，其中：</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 15px 0;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 16px;text-indent: 0;text-wrap: wrap;padding: 0\" data-content-tag=\"15\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: #333333;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px\">　　<span style=\"font-family:宋体\">1.当事人送达地址确认书请填写</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: #333333;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px\">有效、</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: #333333;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px\">联络畅通的地址和联系电话。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 15px 0;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 16px;text-indent: 0;text-wrap: wrap;padding: 0\" data-content-tag=\"16\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: #FF0000;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px\">　　<span style=\"font-family:宋体\">2.证据材料</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px\">请按照证据清单填写的顺序</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: #FF0000;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px\">排序叠放</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: #FF0000;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px\">，</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: #FF0000;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px\">2份（或多份）分开叠放，确保每份材料内容相同，顺序一致</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: #333333;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px\">。</span></p><p style=\";text-align: justify;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px;text-wrap: wrap\" data-content-tag=\"17\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p indenttext=\"　　\" noextractcontent=\"true\">　　</p><p indenttext=\"　　\" noextractcontent=\"true\">　　</p><p indenttext=\"　　\" noextractcontent=\"true\">　　<a target=\"_blank\" download=\"_附件1：白云区劳动仲裁立案所需材料.zip\" class=\"nfw-cms-attachment\" attachment-id=\"7891723\" href=\"https://www.by.gov.cn/attachment/7/7891/7891723/10451075.zip\" alt=\"_附件1：白云区劳动仲裁立案所需材料.zip\">附件1：白云区劳动仲裁立案所需材料.zip</a></p><p indenttext=\"　　\" noextractcontent=\"true\" style=\"line-height: 16px;\">　　<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"nfw-cms-attachment\" attachment-id=\"7886011\" href=\"https://www.by.gov.cn/attachment/7/7886/7886011/10451075.zip\" alt=\"附件2：部分立案材料填写模板（可参考）.zip\">附件2：部分立案材料填写模板（可参考）.zip</a></p><p data-content-tag=\"20\"><br></p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"article-extend\">\n          <span class=\"llcs\">访问量：<b>\n              <span id=\"NFCMS-POST-VISIT-2\">47104</span><script>setTimeout(function(){var s = document.createElement(\"script\");s.type = \"text/javascript\";s.src = \"//statistics.gd.gov.cn/jsonp/post/sum?post=10451075&site=200006&callback=NFCMS_CB_POST_VISIT_2&t=\" + Math.random().toString(35).substr(2);window.NFCMS_CB_POST_VISIT_2 = function(data){document.getElementById(\"NFCMS-POST-VISIT-2\").innerHTML = data.count;document.body.removeChild(s);};document.body.appendChild(s);}, 10);</script>\n                <script>window.NFCMS_SITE_ID=200006;window.NFCMS_PUB_TYPE=\"post\";window.NFCMS_POST_ID=\"10451075\";window.NFCMS_CAT_ID=\"67917\";</script><script src=\"//statistics.gd.gov.cn/scripts/s.js?t=1792051216\" async=\"\"></script>\n            </b></span>\n          <span class=\"print\"><a href=\"javascript:window.print();\" target=\"_self\">打印</a></span>\n          <span class=\"close\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0);\" target=\"_self\" onclick=\"window.close();\">关闭</a></span>\n        </div>\n        <!-- 二维码 开始-->\n        <dl class=\"ar