ipt type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/libs/qrcode/jquery.qrcode.js\"></script>\n  <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/libs/qrcode/qrcode.js\"></script>\n\n\n<div class=\"alert-warning\"><div class=\"alert-delete\"><span id=\"closets\">X</span></div><div class=\"alert-wzsm\"><p>您即将访问非政府网站链接，是否继续？</p></div><div class=\"alert-footer\"><span class=\"continue\">继续访问</span><span class=\"fangqi\">放弃</span></div></div><div class=\"alert-mengban\"></div></body></html>",
